-- VowLMS — Schema Patch 028
-- Seeds the real, hand-authored assessment question banks from
-- src/data/module-assessments/*.ts into the live `assessments` table for the
-- first time. Until now this table has never been populated for any of these
-- 20 certificate-eligible courses (confirmed: no SQL migration in this repo
-- ever inserted into `assessments`) — every submission has been failing with
-- "Assessment not found", which meant no learner could ever pass an assessment
-- or earn a certificate, regardless of how much real progress they made.
--
-- Only scoring-relevant fields are stored (id, type, and the correct-answer
-- field for that type) — question prompts/options/explanations are never read
-- from the database; the frontend always renders those from the same static
-- TS source this migration reads, so nothing here needs to duplicate that copy.
--
-- Requires 001_schema.sql (assessments table). Safe to re-run: INSERT IGNORE
-- keyed on the assessment's unique slug.
-- =============================================================================


